* Ogent Doctor
Status: WARN

** Environment
 ✓ Emacs version          Emacs 30.2 (required >= 29.1)
 ✓ Org version            Org 9.8.10 (required >= 9.8.7)
 ✓ Transient menus        Transient 0.13.8 (required >= 0.13.5)
 ✓ Stale .elc files       No ogent .elc compiled by an Emacs newer than 30

** Transport
 ✓ gptel transport        gptel loaded and `gptel-request' is available
 ✓ gptel tools flag       `gptel-use-tools' is enabled
 ✓ curl transport         curl found at /usr/bin/curl

** Models
 ✓ Model registry         24 model entries registered
 ✓ Default model          Default model: gpt-6.1-sol
 ! gptel backend          Backend gptel-openai is unresolved
                          fix: Define the gptel backend the default model's :backend refers to

** Auth
 · Codex OAuth cache      No Codex auth file at /root/.codex/auth.json
 ! Default model key      Backend for gpt-6.1-sol has not resolved; key check deferred
                          fix: Configure an API key or bearer on the default model's gptel backend
 · Claude OAuth cache     No Claude OAuth token file found

** CLI tools
 ! br issue tracker       br executable not found in PATH
                          fix: Install br (beads_rust) and put it on PATH for issue integration
 · Adapter CLIs           Codex CLI: codex not in PATH
                          Claude Code: claude not in PATH
                          Gemini CLI: gemini not in PATH
                          Cursor Agent: cursor-agent not in PATH
                          OpenCode: opencode not in PATH
                          Pi CLI: unsupported - pi CLI invocation flags are unverified (no local pi --help to ground them)
                          Grok CLI: unsupported - grok CLI invocation flags are unverified (no local grok --help to ground them)
                          GitHub Copilot: copilot not in PATH
                          gptel (in-process): in-process, no CLI needed

** Optional packages
 · org-ql package         org-ql is not installed; installing it unlocks saved-query search over Armory conversations (ogent-armory-ql)
 · vterm package          vterm is not installed; installing it unlocks full terminal emulation for interactive CLI agent sessions (the Armory terminal runtime otherwise uses term.el)
 ✓ markdown-mode package  markdown-mode is available

** Stores
 · Analytics DB           No analytics DB for this project (/work/.ogent-analytics.db)
