":\\\"Exact string to replace (must be unique in file)\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"new_string\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Replacement string\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"replace_all\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"boolean\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"If true, replace all occurrences\\\"}],\\\"effects\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"file\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"workspace\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"file\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"workspace\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"high\\\"}]},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"glob\\\",\\\"aliases\\\":[],\\\"description\\\":\\\"Find files matching a glob pattern. Returns paths sorted by modification time.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"search\\\",\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"async\\\":false,\\\"boolean_representation\\\":\\\"native\\\",\\\"confirmation_required\\\":false,\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"pattern\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Glob pattern like **/*.el or src/**/*.py\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"path\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Directory to search in (default: project root)\\\"}],\\\"effects\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"filesystem\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"workspace\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\"}]},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"grep\\\",\\\"aliases\\\":[],\\\"description\\\":\\\"Search file contents using regex pattern. Uses ripgrep if available.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"search\\\",\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"async\\\":false,\\\"boolean_representation\\\":\\\"native\\\",\\\"confirmation_required\\\":false,\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"pattern\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Regular expression pattern to search for\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"path\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"File or directory to search\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"glob_filter\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Limit search to files matching pattern (e.g., *.el)\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"context_lines\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"integer\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Lines of context around matches\\\"}],\\\"effects\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"filesystem\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"workspace\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\"}]},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"read-file\\\",\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"read_file\\\"],\\\"description\\\":\\\"Read the contents of a file. Returns lines with line numbers.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"filesystem\\\",\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"async\\\":false,\\\"boolean_representation\\\":\\\"native\\\",\\\"confirmation_required\\\":false,\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"file_path\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Absolute path to the file to read\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"offset\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"integer\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Line number to start from (1-indexed)\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"limit\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"integer\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Maximum lines to read\\\"}],\\\"effects\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"file\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"workspace\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\"}]},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"write-file\\\",\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"write_file\\\"],\\\"description\\\":\\\"Write content to a file, creating it if it doesn't exist.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"filesystem\\\",\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"async\\\":false,\\\"boolean_representation\\\":\\\"native\\\",\\\"confirmation_required\\\":true,\\\"risk\\\":\\\"high\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"file_path\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Absolute path to write to\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"content\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Content to write\\\"}],\\\"effects\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"file\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"workspace\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"high\\\"}]}],\\\"result_contract\\\":{\\\"tool_results\\\":\\\"text; errors are signaled or returned as Tool error: text by the execution wrapper\\\",\\\"async_events\\\":[\\\"stdout\\\",\\\"stderr\\\",\\\"done\\\",\\\"error\\\"],\\\"doctor_exit_codes\\\":{\\\"ok\\\":0,\\\"warning\\\":1,\\\"error\\\":2}},\\\"discovery\\\":{\\\"guide\\\":\\\"(ogent-agent-guide)\\\",\\\"triage\\\":\\\"(ogent-agent-triage 'json)\\\",\\\"doctor\\\":\\\"(ogent-doctor-batch nil 'json)\\\"}}\n\")"}
{"label":"guide:current","value":"\"ogent agent guide (contract 1)\nLoad ogent normally, then inspect (ogent-agent-capabilities 'json).\nThis reads the live registry; an empty tools array means no tools are installed.\n(ogent-tools-install-defaults) explicitly installs built-in specs if wanted.\nUse canonical hyphen names or registered underscore aliases; typos get hints, never execution.\nArguments follow registry order; named calls reject unknown/duplicate keys before approval.\nNative boolean false is nil or :json-false; zero and nested objects are preserved.\nMCP calls use :json-false for explicit false; optional nil means omit the argument.\nTool results remain text. JSON discovery and doctor reports use contract_version 1.\nRead: (ogent-tool--read-file \\\"/path/file\\\" 1 200); follow the exact next offset in its footer.\nSearch: (ogent-tool--glob \\\"**/*.el\\\" \\\"/path/project\\\") includes every depth.\nGrep: (ogent-tool--grep \\\"-needle\\\" \\\"/path/project\\\"); no matches is success, invalid regex is an error.\nEdit: old_string must be nonempty and unique; set replace_all to t only for intentional repeated replacement.\nRead-only tools need no confirmation by default. Writes and shell execution require approval.\nDirect ogent-tool-- functions are low-level APIs; use registered execution wrappers for approval enforcement.\nShell: use a positive timeout in seconds and an existing working_directory.\nShell stdout/stderr may be truncated; the final exit code is preserved.\nLocal health: (ogent-agent-triage 'json), no provider requests or MCP handshakes.\nBatch health: (ogent-doctor-batch nil 'json), exit 0=ok/info, 1=warning, 2=error.\nCheck readiness offline: make test; make test-isolation; make offline-test with OGENT_ELPA_DIR.\n\""}
{"label":"triage:current","value":"\"{\\\"contract_version\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"quick_ref\\\":{\\\"contract_version\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"interface\\\":\\\"Emacs Lisp SDK\\\",\\\"tools\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"aliases\\\":[],\\\"description\\\":\\\"Execute a shell command and return output.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"shell\\\",\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"async\\\":false,\\\"boolean_representation\\\":\\\"native\\\",\\\"confirmation_required\\\":true,\\\"risk\\\":\\\"critical\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Shell command to execute\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"working_directory\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Directory to run command in\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"timeout\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"integer\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Timeout in seconds\\\"}],\\\"effects\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"execute\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"shell\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"unrestricted\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"critical\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"filesystem\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"unrestricted\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"high\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"filesystem\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"unrestricted\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"high\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"network\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"external\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"high\\\"}]},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"edit-file\\\",\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"edit_file\\\"],\\\"description\\\":\\\"Replace a string in a file. The old_string must be unique.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"filesystem\\\",\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"async\\\":false,\\\"boolean_representation\\\":\\\"native\\\",\\\"confirmation_required\\\":true,\\\"risk\\\":\\\"high\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"file_path\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Absolute path to the file\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"old_string\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Exact string to replace (must be unique in file)\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"new_string\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Replacement string\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"replace_all\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"boolean\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"If true, replace all occurrences\\\"}],\\\"effects\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"file\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"workspace\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"file\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"workspace\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"high\\\"}]},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"glob\\\",\\\"aliases\\\":[],\\\"description\\\":\\\"Find files matching a glob pattern. Returns paths sorted by modification time.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"search\\\",\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"async\\\":false,\\\"boolean_representation\\\":\\\"native\\\",\\\"confirmation_required\\\":false,\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"pattern\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Glob pattern like **/*.el or src/**/*.py\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"path\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Directory to search in (default: project root)\\\"}],\\\"effects\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"filesystem\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"workspace\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\"}]},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"grep\\\",\\\"aliases\\\":[],\\\"description\\\":\\\"Search file contents using regex pattern. Uses ripgrep if available.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"search\\\",\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"async\\\":false,\\\"boolean_representation\\\":\\\"native\\\",\\\"confirmation_required\\\":false,\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"pattern\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Regular expression pattern to search for\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"path\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"File or directory to search\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"glob_filter\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Limit search to files matching pattern (e.g., *.el)\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"context_lines\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"integer\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Lines of context around matches\\\"}],\\\"effects\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"filesystem\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"workspace\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\"}]},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"read-file\\\",\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"read_file\\\"],\\\"description\\\":\\\"Read the contents of a file. Returns lines with line numbers.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"filesystem\\\",\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"async\\\":false,\\\"boolean_representation\\\":\\\"native\\\",\\\"confirmation_required\\\":false,\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"file_path\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Absolute path to the file to read\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"offset\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"integer\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Line number to start from (1-indexed)\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"limit\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"integer\\\",\\\"optional\\\":true,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Maximum lines to read\\\"}],\\\"effects\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"file\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"workspace\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"low\\\"}]},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"write-file\\\",\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"write_file\\\"],\\\"description\\\":\\\"Write content to a file, creating it if it doesn't exist.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"filesystem\\\",\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"async\\\":false,\\\"boolean_representation\\\":\\\"native\\\",\\\"confirmation_required\\\":true,\\\"risk\\\":\\\"high\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"file_path\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Absolute path to write to\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"content\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"optional\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Content to write\\\"}],\\\"effects\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"file\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"workspace\\\",\\\"risk\\\":\\\"high\\\"}]}],\\\"result_contract\\\":{\\\"tool_results\\\":\\\"text; errors are signaled or returned as Tool error: text by the execution wrapper\\\",\\\"async_events\\\":[\\\"stdout\\\",\\\"stderr\\\",\\\"done\\\",\\\"error\\\"],\\\"doctor_exit_codes\\\":{\\\"ok\\\":0,\\\"warning\\\":1,\\\"error\\\":2}},\\\"discovery\\\":{\\\"guide\\\":\\\"(ogent-agent-guide)\\\",\\\"triage\\\":\\\"(ogent-agent-triage 'json)\\\",\\\"doctor\\\":\\\"(ogent-doctor-batch nil 'json)\\\"}},\\\"recommendations\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"backend\\\",\\\"action\\\":\\\"Define the gptel backend the default model's :backend refers to\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"default-model-key\\\",\\\"action\\\":\\\"Configure an API key or bearer on the default model's gptel backend\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"br\\\",\\\"action\\\":\\\"Install br (beads_rust) and put it on PATH for issue integration\\\"}],\\\"commands\\\":[\\\"(ogent-agent-guide)\\\",\\\"(ogent-doctor-batch nil 'json)\\\",\\\"make test\\\",\\\"make test-isolation\\\",\\\"make offline-test\\\"],\\\"project_health\\\":{\\\"contract_version\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"warn\\\",\\\"exit_code\\\":1,\\\"checks\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"emacs-version\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Emacs version\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"environment\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Emacs 30.2 (required >= 29.1)\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Upgrade Emacs to at least the version in `ogent-doctor-required-emacs-version'\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"org-version\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Org version\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"environment\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Org 9.8.10 (required >= 9.8.7)\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Upgrade Org to at least the version in `ogent-doctor-required-org-version'\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"transient\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Transient menus\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"environment\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Transient 0.13.8 (required >= 0.13.5)\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Upgrade Transient to at least the version in `ogent-doctor-required-transient-version'\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"gptel\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"gptel transport\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"transport\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"gptel loaded and `gptel-request' is available\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Install gptel (M-x package-install RET gptel RET)\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"gptel-tools\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"gptel tools flag\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"transport\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"`gptel-use-tools' is enabled\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Set `gptel-use-tools' non-nil so ogent tools can run\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"model-registry\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Model registry\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"models\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"24 model entries registered\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Give every `ogent-model-registry' entry an :id and a :backend\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"default-model\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Default model\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"models\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Default model: gpt-6.1-sol\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Set `ogent-default-model' to a registered model id\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"backend\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"gptel backend\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"models\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"warn\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Backend gptel-openai is unresolved\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Define the gptel backend the default model's :backend refers to\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"codex-auth\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Codex OAuth cache\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"auth\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"info\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"No Codex auth file at /root/.codex/auth.json\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Run `codex login' to refresh the Codex auth cache\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"default-model-key\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Default model key\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"auth\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"warn\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Backend for gpt-6.1-sol has not resolved; key check deferred\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Configure an API key or bearer on the default model's gptel backend\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"anthropic-auth\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Claude OAuth cache\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"auth\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"info\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"No Claude OAuth token file found\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Run M-x ogent-anthropic-login to refresh the OAuth tokens\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"br\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"br issue tracker\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"cli\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"warn\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"br executable not found in PATH\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Install br (beads_rust) and put it on PATH for issue integration\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"adapter-clis\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Adapter CLIs\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"cli\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"info\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Codex CLI: codex not in PATH\\\\nClaude Code: claude not in PATH\\\\nGemini CLI: gemini not in PATH\\\\nCursor Agent: cursor-agent not in PATH\\\\nOpenCode: opencode not in PATH\\\\nPi CLI: unsupported - pi CLI invocation flags are unverified (no local pi --help to ground them)\\\\nGrok CLI: unsupported - grok CLI invocation flags are unverified (no local grok --help to ground them)\\\\nGitHub Copilot: copilot not in PATH\\\\ngptel (in-process): in-process, no CLI needed\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Install the adapter CLIs you plan to run through the Armory\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"curl\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"curl transport\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"transport\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"curl found at /usr/bin/curl\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Install curl to enable streaming MCP HTTP transport\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"org-ql\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"org-ql package\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"optional\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"info\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"org-ql is not installed; installing it unlocks saved-query search over Armory conversations (ogent-armory-ql)\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"vterm\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"vterm package\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"optional\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"info\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"vterm is not installed; installing it unlocks full terminal emulation for interactive CLI agent sessions (the Armory terminal runtime otherwise uses term.el)\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"markdown-mode\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"markdown-mode package\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"optional\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"markdown-mode is available\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"analytics-db\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Analytics DB\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"stores\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"info\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"No analytics DB for this project (/work/.ogent-analytics.db)\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Move the corrupt analytics DB aside; ogent recreates it on next use\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"stale-elc\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Stale .elc files\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"environment\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"No ogent .elc compiled by an Emacs newer than 30\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Recompile ogent with the running Emacs, or move the newer-Emacs .elc aside\\\"}]}}\n\""}
{"label":"doctor:json","value":"(:stdout \"{\\\"contract_version\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"warn\\\",\\\"exit_code\\\":1,\\\"checks\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"emacs-version\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Emacs version\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"environment\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Emacs 30.2 (required >= 29.1)\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Upgrade Emacs to at least the version in `ogent-doctor-required-emacs-version'\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"org-version\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Org version\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"environment\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Org 9.8.10 (required >= 9.8.7)\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Upgrade Org to at least the version in `ogent-doctor-required-org-version'\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"transient\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Transient menus\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"environment\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Transient 0.13.8 (required >= 0.13.5)\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Upgrade Transient to at least the version in `ogent-doctor-required-transient-version'\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"gptel\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"gptel transport\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"transport\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"gptel loaded and `gptel-request' is available\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Install gptel (M-x package-install RET gptel RET)\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"gptel-tools\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"gptel tools flag\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"transport\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"`gptel-use-tools' is enabled\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Set `gptel-use-tools' non-nil so ogent tools can run\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"model-registry\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Model registry\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"models\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"24 model entries registered\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Give every `ogent-model-registry' entry an :id and a :backend\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"default-model\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Default model\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"models\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Default model: gpt-6.1-sol\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Set `ogent-default-model' to a registered model id\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"backend\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"gptel backend\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"models\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"warn\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Backend gptel-openai is unresolved\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Define the gptel backend the default model's :backend refers to\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"codex-auth\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Codex OAuth cache\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"auth\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"info\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"No Codex auth file at /root/.codex/auth.json\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Run `codex login' to refresh the Codex auth cache\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"default-model-key\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Default model key\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"auth\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"warn\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Backend for gpt-6.1-sol has not resolved; key check deferred\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Configure an API key or bearer on the default model's gptel backend\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"anthropic-auth\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Claude OAuth cache\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"auth\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"info\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"No Claude OAuth token file found\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Run M-x ogent-anthropic-login to refresh the OAuth tokens\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"br\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"br issue tracker\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"cli\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"warn\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"br executable not found in PATH\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Install br (beads_rust) and put it on PATH for issue integration\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"adapter-clis\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Adapter CLIs\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"cli\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"info\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Codex CLI: codex not in PATH\\\\nClaude Code: claude not in PATH\\\\nGemini CLI: gemini not in PATH\\\\nCursor Agent: cursor-agent not in PATH\\\\nOpenCode: opencode not in PATH\\\\nPi CLI: unsupported - pi CLI invocation flags are unverified (no local pi --help to ground them)\\\\nGrok CLI: unsupported - grok CLI invocation flags are unverified (no local grok --help to ground them)\\\\nGitHub Copilot: copilot not in PATH\\\\ngptel (in-process): in-process, no CLI needed\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Install the adapter CLIs you plan to run through the Armory\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"curl\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"curl transport\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"transport\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"curl found at /usr/bin/curl\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Install curl to enable streaming MCP HTTP transport\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"org-ql\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"org-ql package\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"optional\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"info\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"org-ql is not installed; installing it unlocks saved-query search over Armory conversations (ogent-armory-ql)\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"vterm\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"vterm package\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"optional\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"info\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"vterm is not installed; installing it unlocks full terminal emulation for interactive CLI agent sessions (the Armory terminal runtime otherwise uses term.el)\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"markdown-mode\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"markdown-mode package\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"optional\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"markdown-mode is available\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"analytics-db\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Analytics DB\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"stores\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"info\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"No analytics DB for this project (/work/.ogent-analytics.db)\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Move the corrupt analytics DB aside; ogent recreates it on next use\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"stale-elc\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Stale .elc files\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"environment\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"No ogent .elc compiled by an Emacs newer than 30\\\",\\\"remediation\\\":\\\"Recompile ogent with the running Emacs, or move the newer-Emacs .elc aside\\\"}]}\n\" :code 1)"}
